~ convo_1
Fenn: Hey Mister Wizard, do you like ice cream?
Winston: Woooow. Asking thy 'cold guy' if he doth liketh ice cream. Very original.
Fenn: Well... do you?
Winston: Wha- NAY!!
Winston: Tis a mockery of nature. An insult to everything which is cold.
Fenn: Are- are you lactose intolerant?
Winston: And there thou art! Assuming I'm lactose intolerant just because I liketh not ice cream!
Fenn: Well, are you?
Winston: Tis besides the point!
=> END

~ convo_2
Winston: Go away, pint-size.
Fenn: Why?
Winston: Wha-? Shut up! I doth be busy! Go away.
Fenn: Aw okay.
=> END

~ convo_3
Winston: Hey, pint-size, you seem close with Az
Fenn: Oh yeah! She's great
Winston: D-Does she, like... I dunno... 
Fenn: What?
Winston: What doth she, like, think? Liketh regarding me?
Winston: Doth she thinketh I'm cool?
Fenn: Yeah of course! Everyone thinks you're cool!
Winston: Really?!
Az: NO! Fenn, stop making stuff up.
Fenn: But I wasn't...
Winston whispering: I forgoteth she was there...
=> END

~ convo_4
